{"id":"sospechoso","lemma":"sospechoso","pos":"adj","rank":1018,"glosses":["suspicious, suspect, fishy, shady, sketchy","shifty"],"ipa":"/sospeˈt͡ʃoso/","forms":{"feminine":"sospechosa","masculinePlural":"sospechosos","femininePlural":"sospechosas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d9/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-sospechoso.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Tom es un sospechoso?","en":"Is Tom a suspect?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/799206","words":[null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"¿La policía tiene algún sospechoso?","en":"Do the police have any suspects?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/608535","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"Civility"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},null,null]},{"text":"Creo que todos somos sospechosos.","en":"I think we're all suspects.","words":[{"g":"to believe","l":"creer"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"all","l":"todo"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]},{"text":"Yo no vi nada sospechoso.","en":"I didn't see anything suspicious.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/598545","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to see, to spot","l":"ver"},{"g":"nothing"},null]},{"text":"La manera en que ella nos habló fue sospechosa.","en":"The way she spoke to us was suspicious.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"way"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"she"},{"g":"us"},{"g":"to talk","l":"hablar"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]}]}